[{:db/id "q-3536/selection/9cbf4874faee49f3dd41c7149f63db8440bc8ff64751d49f1ef10188c847afbb" :answer/id #uuid "15925787-6f45-5e4b-ab00-deac43d4c67c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{2}{t-2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-3536/selection/267fa73d1b19da6cadcca76d8477abc44ea7259edbd9b15ecf6ffdb8872833ef" :answer/id #uuid "2ed7d801-2e96-584d-bb2f-4bd9e4288920" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{2}{(t-2)t}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-3536/selection/2fba22d3ffdc823af8ea06e7974311fce55ef508cf2a45b382eff74a97296ec3" :answer/id #uuid "d3f575b2-4dc8-576c-8c50-24a3e97abbcd" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{2-2t}{(t-2)t}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-3536/selection/727d7fb9cb6c0e86430b0084620c561f27d93acac0ccfc7503e4e0f2bde083d4" :answer/id #uuid "399920da-3e7f-5dec-aecf-11dd7c5447e5" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{2t-2}{(t-2)t}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-3536/selection/fd56a44fcf668523a052f8b252a3c0c3bd9f71b542e5e7de56b334774a87d204" :answer/id #uuid "d3fd17ba-e11c-5b9e-9ae6-c7ee60429070" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{2}{(t-2)t}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-3536/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "1a038ec0-35ac-5423-8b8c-c9f80bf760dd" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-3536/selection/267fa73d1b19da6cadcca76d8477abc44ea7259edbd9b15ecf6ffdb8872833ef" :answer-field/choices ["q-3536/selection/9cbf4874faee49f3dd41c7149f63db8440bc8ff64751d49f1ef10188c847afbb" "q-3536/selection/267fa73d1b19da6cadcca76d8477abc44ea7259edbd9b15ecf6ffdb8872833ef" "q-3536/selection/2fba22d3ffdc823af8ea06e7974311fce55ef508cf2a45b382eff74a97296ec3" "q-3536/selection/727d7fb9cb6c0e86430b0084620c561f27d93acac0ccfc7503e4e0f2bde083d4" "q-3536/selection/fd56a44fcf668523a052f8b252a3c0c3bd9f71b542e5e7de56b334774a87d204"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-3536" :question/id #uuid "b53c8651-7b70-5e98-a3c4-9fffe26fc66c" :question/math-academy-id "q-3536" :question/problem "$\\frac{1}{t}-\\frac{1}{t-2}=$" :question/worked-solution "In this case, we need to put the fractions over a common denominator of $t(t-2),$ since there are no common factors in either denominator that we can exploit.\n\nTo do this, we multiply the top and bottom of the first fraction by $t-2$, and the top and bottom of the second fraction by $t:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1}{t}-\\frac{1}{t-2} & = \\\\ \\frac{t-2}{t-2}\\cdot \\frac{1}{t}-\\frac{t}{t}\\cdot \\frac{1}{t-2} & = \\\\ \\frac{t-2}{(t-2)t}-\\frac{t}{t(t-2)} & = \\\\ \\frac{t-2-t}{(t-2)t} & = \\\\ -\\frac{2}{(t-2)t} & \\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-3536/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "3db20b82-9561-5c54-8e12-8914bb6747c3"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-3536"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-70147/selection/a034558a1e5eb96d9962290c35298399340e972b9d26fee50a77fffb09be3dc5" :answer/id #uuid "f708c51f-eb7b-5e1e-9644-f632b7936745" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{5-3x}{1-x}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-70147/selection/64feb8e4eaf6fa9c2a356812d1c877b0b861236d8777bf2491ab48aa1ddfc1e7" :answer/id #uuid "f5525739-78ae-5289-9200-b5bb17e90128" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{3-2x}{x-1}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-70147/selection/4e6f9fff6368b6e8d943dcfd478a1cde2977a5f2ea52292c0b0920912f219fef" :answer/id #uuid "03a74146-29cd-50c3-95cb-9064b0cbdbcd" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{2-x}{1-x}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-70147/selection/29ebad8cf84add7f40e437242ca8d685851a1d38b7aa197747ef98255bd5bf57" :answer/id #uuid "362d2279-58bc-5141-9962-d8f8269396f7" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{3+x}{x-1}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-70147/selection/e5a9e7bcc5f2c98c030ea144c95bba412d0377bd41f99c3bd32fde79b30c151f" :answer/id #uuid "b1431eba-7e4c-5832-ab6f-eb91f767d252" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1+2x}{1-x}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-70147/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "54a315ea-ff6e-5bb7-9940-f36721f06172" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-70147/selection/a034558a1e5eb96d9962290c35298399340e972b9d26fee50a77fffb09be3dc5" :answer-field/choices ["q-70147/selection/a034558a1e5eb96d9962290c35298399340e972b9d26fee50a77fffb09be3dc5" "q-70147/selection/64feb8e4eaf6fa9c2a356812d1c877b0b861236d8777bf2491ab48aa1ddfc1e7" "q-70147/selection/4e6f9fff6368b6e8d943dcfd478a1cde2977a5f2ea52292c0b0920912f219fef" "q-70147/selection/29ebad8cf84add7f40e437242ca8d685851a1d38b7aa197747ef98255bd5bf57" "q-70147/selection/e5a9e7bcc5f2c98c030ea144c95bba412d0377bd41f99c3bd32fde79b30c151f"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-70147" :question/id #uuid "53c1e98e-1b68-51ba-b58c-a209f1eb5781" :question/math-academy-id "q-70147" :question/problem "Write $2+\\frac{3-x}{1-x}$ as a single fraction." :question/worked-solution "Using the fact that $2=\\frac{2}{1},$ we can write the expression as\n\n$$\n\\frac{2}{1}+\\frac{3-x}{1-x}.\n$$\n\n \n\nIn order to add the two fractions, we need them to have a common denominator. So, we put both fractions over a common denominator of $1-x$ by multiplying the top and bottom of the first fraction by $1-x:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{2}{1}+\\frac{3-x}{1-x} & = \\\\ \\frac{1-x}{1-x}\\cdot \\frac{2}{1}+\\frac{3-x}{1-x} & = \\\\ \\frac{2(1-x)}{1-x}+\\frac{3-x}{1-x} & \\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we add the fractions and simplify the result:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{2(1-x)}{1-x}+\\frac{3-x}{1-x} & = \\\\ \\frac{2(1-x)+(3-x)}{1-x} & = \\\\ \\frac{2-2x+3-x}{1-x} & = \\\\ \\frac{5-3x}{1-x}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-70147/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "63080bb8-7a6a-505d-813a-e6c99d337064"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-70147"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-70294/selection/4f292898e3f130d92b9a63911502c18537bb310a1432646467ad4b80436961ae" :answer/id #uuid "4b4a1bc4-45d8-5289-a8af-3f457aa80784" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{8xy+4x-2y}{(2x+1)(y+1)}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-70294/selection/1b9a2309450638c9652a16636f2d632378e5244e6868ba07770acba962a4acda" :answer/id #uuid "d50f41e2-80a0-5862-99eb-56af5958d76e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{4x-2y}{(2x+1)(y+1)}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-70294/selection/84df30ab33dfd867f67af5c5d13e352f2875b4f2743f5b071c1e2b1d92603412" :answer/id #uuid "74c65bca-9268-5479-af2c-ecb28ae0391d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{6xy+x-2y}{(2x+1)(y+1)}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-70294/selection/4ee4ec25dd9dfcd65b53e62208282703ce482471fb9eedbfea740984bfcfffe0" :answer/id #uuid "1834367f-6750-5f83-a7f7-4c472d2cb929" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{x-2y}{(x+1)(y+1)}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-70294/selection/97c87716d395d8e2e1fee8e343f454b929425e80f065fc133aa79452527b23bf" :answer/id #uuid "ac889359-8e98-578c-9f27-454a63033eeb" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{x+y}{(2x+1)(y+1)}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-70294/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "18f06b84-c61a-5544-b2a2-fbc145ba6b93" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-70294/selection/1b9a2309450638c9652a16636f2d632378e5244e6868ba07770acba962a4acda" :answer-field/choices ["q-70294/selection/4f292898e3f130d92b9a63911502c18537bb310a1432646467ad4b80436961ae" "q-70294/selection/1b9a2309450638c9652a16636f2d632378e5244e6868ba07770acba962a4acda" "q-70294/selection/84df30ab33dfd867f67af5c5d13e352f2875b4f2743f5b071c1e2b1d92603412" "q-70294/selection/4ee4ec25dd9dfcd65b53e62208282703ce482471fb9eedbfea740984bfcfffe0" "q-70294/selection/97c87716d395d8e2e1fee8e343f454b929425e80f065fc133aa79452527b23bf"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-70294" :question/id #uuid "9ae8d3b9-143b-5b5e-b902-d2a896c99f49" :question/math-academy-id "q-70294" :question/problem "$\\frac{4x}{2x+1}-\\frac{2y}{y+1}=$" :question/worked-solution "In this case, we need to put the fractions over a common denominator of $(2x+1)(y+1),$ since there are no common factors in either denominator that we can exploit. \n\nTo do this, we multiply the top and bottom of the first fraction by $y+1,$ and the top and bottom of the second fraction by $2x+1:$ \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{4x}{2x+1}-\\frac{2y}{y+1} & = \\\\ \\frac{y+1}{y+1}\\cdot \\frac{4x}{2x+1}-\\frac{2x+1}{2x+1}\\cdot \\frac{2y}{y+1} & = \\\\ \\frac{4x(y+1)}{(2x+1)(y+1)}-\\frac{(2x+1)2y}{(2x+1)(y+1)} & = \\\\ \\frac{4x(y+1)-(2x+1)2y}{(2x+1)(y+1)} & = \\\\ \\frac{4xy+4x-4xy-2y}{(2x+1)(y+1)} & = \\\\ \\frac{4x-2y}{(2x+1)(y+1)} & \\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["q-70294/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "3db20b82-9561-5c54-8e12-8914bb6747c3"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-70294"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-79545/selection/6b6746c077897d4a87a9f9d7a25db4a4e2097dc5e2d7ef4d4f0740b72274acf1" :answer/id #uuid "ab83a3aa-62d5-5a9c-a489-8de48df6c84f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{3a+2}{a}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-79545/selection/fda24ead04c84e3fc5e0e8c0d2bb0d9679544e0af35b2296801a1d31a71501b8" :answer/id #uuid "2d62d85c-e29a-5d1a-bfb0-baaf28d5f750" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{2-3a}{a}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-79545/selection/a5844596357fcf584073124bd38796a5683d9a9bac35944a5001b4689c04c093" :answer/id #uuid "b2eab698-b4aa-556a-991e-334cede2